{"seq":3,"slug":"cap-theorem-and-tradeoffs","title":"CAP 定理与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/foundations/cap-theorem-and-tradeoffs","wordCount":1530,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"cap-定理与权衡\">CAP 定理与权衡</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CAP 定理给出了分布式系统不可回避的理论边界：一致性（C）、可用性（A）、分区容错性（P）三者最多同时满足两个。本篇的几个基础概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P 必须保证</strong>：网络分区不可避免，因此实际选择发生在 C 与 A 之间——CP 系统拒绝不一致的请求，AP 系统继续服务但可能返回过期数据。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性是光谱而非开关</strong>：强一致 → 线性一致 → 顺序一致 → 因果一致 → 最终一致，保证强度与延迟同向变化。</li>\n<li><strong>最终一致的实现</strong>：读时修复、反熵协议（如 Cassandra 的 Merkle Tree）、冲突解决（Last-Write-Wins、向量时钟、CRDT）。</li>\n<li><strong>PACELC</strong>：在无分区（Else）的日常状态下，仍需在延迟（L）与一致性（C）之间权衡，这更贴近工程决策。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡没有标准答案</strong>：DynamoDB 选择 AP 换取随时可用，Spanner 用 TrueTime 以极高基础设施成本换取全球强一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cap-定理的核心内容\">CAP 定理的核心内容</h2><p>CAP 定理（又称布鲁尔定理）是分布式系统设计中最基础的理论框架。它指出，在一个分布式系统中，以下三个属性最多只能同时满足两个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>C（Consistency）一致性</strong>：所有节点在同一时刻看到相同的数据</li>\n<li><strong>A（Availability）可用性</strong>：每个请求都能收到非错误的响应（不保证是最新数据）</li>\n<li><strong>P（Partition Tolerance）分区容错性</strong>：即使网络分区发生，系统仍能继续运行</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CAP((CAP 定理))&#10;    C[一致性&lt;br/&gt;Consistency]&#10;    A[可用性&lt;br/&gt;Availability]&#10;    P[分区容错性&lt;br/&gt;Partition Tolerance]&#10;&#10;    CAP --- C&#10;    CAP --- A&#10;    CAP --- P&#10;&#10;    CP[CP 系统&lt;br/&gt;HBase, ZooKeeper, MongoDB]&#10;    AP[AP 系统&lt;br/&gt;Cassandra, DynamoDB, CouchDB]&#10;    CA[CA 系统&lt;br/&gt;传统单机 RDBMS]&#10;&#10;    C --- CP&#10;    C --- CA&#10;    A --- AP&#10;    A --- CA&#10;    P --- CP&#10;    P --- AP\">graph TD\n    CAP((CAP 定理))\n    C[一致性&lt;br/&gt;Consistency]\n    A[可用性&lt;br/&gt;Availability]\n    P[分区容错性&lt;br/&gt;Partition Tolerance]\n\n    CAP --- C\n    CAP --- A\n    CAP --- P\n\n    CP[CP 系统&lt;br/&gt;HBase, ZooKeeper, MongoDB]\n    AP[AP 系统&lt;br/&gt;Cassandra, DynamoDB, CouchDB]\n    CA[CA 系统&lt;br/&gt;传统单机 RDBMS]\n\n    C --- CP\n    C --- CA\n    A --- AP\n    A --- CA\n    P --- CP\n    P --- AP</pre><p>在网络环境中，分区（Partition）是<strong>不可避免</strong>的——网络延迟、交换机故障、光纤切断随时可能发生。因此，P 是必须保证的。这意味着实际的选择是在 <strong>C 和 A 之间做权衡</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"理解网络分区\">理解网络分区</h2><p>网络分区指的是分布式系统中的部分节点之间无法通信：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant N1 as 节点 1(数据中心 A)&#10;    participant N2 as 节点 2(数据中心 B)&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;N1: 写入 x = 1&#10;    N1-&gt;&gt;N1: 本地更新 x = 1&#10;    N1--xN2: 同步失败(网络分区)&#10;&#10;    Note over N1,N2: 此时 N1.x = 1, N2.x = 旧值&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;N2: 读取 x&#10;    Note over N2: CP 选择:拒绝服务(保一致性)&#10;    Note over N2: AP 选择:返回旧值(保可用性)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant N1 as 节点 1(数据中心 A)\n    participant N2 as 节点 2(数据中心 B)\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;N1: 写入 x = 1\n    N1-&gt;&gt;N1: 本地更新 x = 1\n    N1--xN2: 同步失败(网络分区)\n\n    Note over N1,N2: 此时 N1.x = 1, N2.x = 旧值\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;N2: 读取 x\n    Note over N2: CP 选择:拒绝服务(保一致性)\n    Note over N2: AP 选择:返回旧值(保可用性)</pre><h3 id=\"cp-系统的行为\">CP 系统的行为</h3><p>当网络分区发生时，CP 系统<strong>拒绝不一致的请求</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CPNode {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  data: Map&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  peers: CPNode[];&#10;  isPartitioned: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function cpRead(node: CPNode, key: string): string | Error {&#10;  if (node.isPartitioned) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;Service Unavailable: cannot guarantee consistency&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const quorumSize = Math.floor(node.peers.length / 2) + 1;&#10;  const responses = node.peers.filter((peer) =&gt; !peer.isPartitioned).map((peer) =&gt; peer.data.get(key));&#10;&#10;  if (responses.length &lt; quorumSize) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;Service Unavailable: quorum not reached&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return responses[0] ?? &#39;&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CPNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  peers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CPNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isPartitioned</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cpRead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CPNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.isPartitioned) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Service Unavailable: cannot guarantee consistency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> quorumSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.peers.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> responses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.peers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">peer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">peer.isPartitioned).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">peer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peer.data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (responses.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quorumSize) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Service Unavailable: quorum not reached'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> responses[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型的 CP 系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ZooKeeper</strong>：分布式协调服务，必须保证配置数据的强一致性</li>\n<li><strong>HBase</strong>：强一致性的列族数据库</li>\n<li><strong>etcd</strong>：Kubernetes 的元数据存储，使用 Raft 共识算法</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ap-系统的行为\">AP 系统的行为</h3><p>当网络分区发生时，AP 系统<strong>继续提供服务但可能返回过期数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface APNode {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  data: Map&lt;string, { value: string; timestamp: number }&gt;;&#10;  peers: APNode[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function apRead(node: APNode, key: string): string {&#10;  const entry = node.data.get(key);&#10;  return entry?.value ?? &#39;&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function apWrite(node: APNode, key: string, value: string): void {&#10;  const timestamp = Date.now();&#10;  node.data.set(key, { value, timestamp });&#10;&#10;  for (const peer of node.peers) {&#10;    try {&#10;      syncToPeer(peer, key, value, timestamp);&#10;    } catch {&#10;      queueForLaterSync(peer, key, value, timestamp);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function syncToPeer(peer: APNode, key: string, value: string, timestamp: number): void {&#10;  const existing = peer.data.get(key);&#10;  if (!existing || existing.timestamp &lt; timestamp) {&#10;    peer.data.set(key, { value, timestamp });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function queueForLaterSync(_peer: APNode, _key: string, _value: string, _timestamp: number): void {&#10;  // ...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> APNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timestamp</span><spa